{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Wingkit 把多款實用小工具集合於一身，適合需要製作截圖展示、宣傳短片或快速修圖的用家。除了截圖加框與影片剪輯，它亦支援圖片編輯、網頁連結整理與檔案處理，原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-153.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>截圖加框與短片製作</h2>\n<p>Wingkit 可為截圖加上手機外框並調整背景與角度；把影片與螢幕錄影剪成宣傳短片，加入點按指示突出重點；圖片編輯支援加文字、疊圖、模糊私密細節、批量調整尺寸及合併長圖。另可儲存網頁連結並分類搜尋，抽出 MP3 音訊與批量重新命名檔案。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-154-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-155-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-156-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-157-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Wingkit</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/wingkit/id6816937705?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:40.321922+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":273,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T22:31:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:17:57.795756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:32.087184+00:00","content_hash":"e2f094355dfc01840780901c7e8ab685abfdd46381743db519038f925089832f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:40.321922+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}